== the week the night workers' demand goes national
tier: life event
route: rallying_voice
shape: any
kind: contest
rungs: 4
fork:
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
age: 26-85
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
tone: mixed
life: publiclife, community
horizon: week
roles: colleague, rival, ally
earth: the movement's demand reaches the country's ministers, and one week will show which way it is won
tribal: the demand is carried to the great moot of all the clans, and one gathering will settle it
magic: the demand reaches the crown's council, and one week of audiences will settle it
scene: The demand has spread across the country, and the ministry invites a delegation to talks next week. In the same week the movement's wider wing plans a stoppage of the night routes in every city. Both sides want {N} at the front, and whatever {N} does will be seen nationally.
scene tribal: The demand has spread to every clan, and the great moot will hear it at the full moon. In the same days the young of the clans mean to block the trading paths until they are heard. Both want {N} at the front.
scene magic: The demand has spread through the realm, and the crown's council grants an audience next week. In the same week the guilds of the cities mean to shut the night gates everywhere. Both want {N} at the front.
- W | lead the delegation, and keep to the agreed list of demands | v: conformity, security | aim: try | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 60
- U | go to the talks with a costed plan the ministers cannot easily wave away | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: try | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 55
- B | go into the talks with the stoppage held back as a threat | v: power, achievement | aim: try | foot: person rival | chance: 50
- R | lead the stoppage, and let the talks wait until the country feels it | v: stimulation, self-direction | aim: try | foot: mark defied an authority | chance: 45
- G | stay out of both, and let the movement choose its own voice this time | v: benevolence, security | aim: skip | foot: lesson a movement outgrows its voice | chance: 85
- W>U | ask the ministry to publish the terms of the talks before agreeing to come | v: conformity, self-direction | aim: try | foot: lesson open terms, fewer tricks | chance: 55
- U>B | split the week: talks by day, and a quiet count of who would stop by night | v: self-direction, power | aim: try | foot: person colleague | chance: 50
- B>R | announce the stoppage on air, then walk into the talks | v: power, stimulation | aim: try | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 45
- R>G | march with the night workers, and carry their own words into the ministry | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: try | foot: means ties+.04 | chance: 55
- G>W | let the delegation go without {N}, and keep the local groups steady | v: benevolence, conformity | aim: skip | foot: means time+.04 | chance: 85
works not G G>W: Whatever the week settles, the demand is spoken of nationally now, and {N} is one of the voices saying it.
works: The choice is one {N} can stand behind when the papers ask, and they do ask.
fails not G G>W: The ministers give little, and the movement argues over whose fault it is.
fails: Some in the movement feel let down by the choice, and say so loudly.

