scene tribal: The gathering {N} called ran on into the night, and some at its edge trampled the winter stores of a neighbouring family. Nobody was hurt, but the family wants names, the elders want an answer by morning, and the movement is split.
scene magic: The gathering {N} called spilled into the market, and some at its edge overturned the stalls. Nobody was badly hurt, but the stallholders want names, the watch wants an answer by morning, and the movement is split.
