rungs: 0 1
fork:
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
age: 16-80
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
tone: joy
life: interests, work
horizon: week
roles: mentor, friend, rival
earth: weekly work at {aim.place} on something odd and {Ns} own, while the regular slot wants the usual
tribal: nights at the fire working on a strange new way of {aim.doing}, while the clan wants the old favourites
magic: evenings in the guild's practice room on a strange new manner of {aim.doing}, while the patrons ask for the usual
scene: Every week {N} works at {aim.doing} at {aim.place}, and something odd has started to come out of it: a way of doing it nobody else does. The regular Friday slot pays, and the people who run it want the usual, well done. The next Friday is four days away.
scene tribal: Night after night {N} works at {aim.doing} by the fire, and something strange has started to come of it, a way nobody in the clan has seen. The clan wants the old favourites at the next feast, and the feast is in four days.
