- W>U | accept, and set up a standing table with the farmers before summer | v: conformity, self-direction | aim: take | foot: lesson a table before a fight | chance: 65
- U>B | ask to start in the autumn, once the home reserve has a new keeper | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: ease | foot: door turned down a chance | chance: 75
