- R>G | decline the post, and help at the drying wetland as a volunteer | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: decline | foot: place prod.wild | chance: 80
- G>W | let the national road go, and train the next keeper of the home stretch | v: benevolence, conformity | aim: stop | foot: person colleague | chance: 85
