- W>B | agree compensation in writing, and redesign the banks with the farm's say | v: conformity, power | aim: work | foot: means money-.06 | chance: 60
- U>R | rebuild the banks lower, so the next high water spreads on the reserve side | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: work | foot: lesson give the water room | chance: 60
