scene tribal: The way of {Ns} helping circles is copied by clans across the plain, and the great moot offers {N} the keeping of every clan's circle. The condition is one custom for all, set at the moot. The circles would gain stores and lose some of their own say. The moot wants an answer by the new moon.
scene magic: The federation of circles {N} founded is copied in towns across the realm, and the crown's almonry offers {N} its mastership. The condition is that the circles come under the almonry's seal and rules. They would gain coin and lose some of their own say. The answer is wanted by the month's end.
