earth: money from the shared winter fund goes missing in one town's group, and the others want that group out
tribal: stores from the shared winter cache vanish from one camp's keeping, and the other camps want it cut off
magic: coin from the circles' winter chest goes missing in one town, and the other circles want that town struck off
scene: Money from the federation's shared winter fund has gone missing in one town's group, where {friend} keeps the books. Nobody knows yet whether it was theft or muddle. The other groups want that town expelled before the winter rota starts, and the town's group says it is being judged by outsiders.
scene tribal: Stores from the shared winter cache have gone from one camp's keeping, where {friend} counts them. Nobody knows yet whether they were taken or miscounted. The other camps want that camp cut off before the snows, and its people say they are being judged by strangers.
scene magic: Coin from the circles' winter chest has gone missing in one town, where {friend} keeps the ledger. Nobody knows yet whether it was theft or muddle. The other circles want that town struck off before the winter rota, and its circle says it is judged by outsiders.
- W | call in an independent audit, and follow the federation's rules on what it finds | v: conformity, universalism | aim: work | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 70
- U | go through the books with {friend} line by line before anyone is blamed | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: work | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 65
- B | suspend the town's group from the fund until the money is back | v: power, security | aim: work | foot: person rival | chance: 55
- R | cover that town's winter rota personally while it is sorted out | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: work | foot: means time-.06 | chance: 60
- G | step down as coordinator, and let the groups settle it among themselves | v: benevolence, security | aim: stop | foot: lesson the groups can stand alone | chance: 85
- W>B | set new rules for the fund: two signatures, books shown monthly | v: conformity, power | aim: work | foot: lesson two keys on the chest | chance: 65
- U>R | let the town's group run its own inquiry, with one outsider watching | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: work | foot: person colleague | chance: 60
- B>G | make up the missing sum from a backer, so the winter meals go on | v: achievement, benevolence | aim: work | foot: means ties+.04 | chance: 60
- R>W | go to the town's group and face their anger at their own meeting | v: stimulation, conformity | aim: work | foot: person friend | chance: 65
- G>U | let the federation go, and keep what it taught about trust | v: tradition, self-direction | aim: stop | foot: lesson trust needs checking | chance: 85
works: The money is traced, most of it to muddle, and the town's group stays in with new rules.
works: The winter meals go out on time, and the federation is a little wiser about money.
fails: The matter drags into winter, and the town's group stops coming to meetings.
fails: Whatever the books show, some trust is gone, and it comes back slowly.
